@startuml
title Диаграмма контейнеров — Knowledge Graph

actor "Пользователь" as User

package "Локальная среда (Docker Compose)" {

    component "Frontend\n(Svelte 5 + nginx proxy)" as Frontend
    component "Backend\n(Go + Gin)" as Backend
    component "Worker\n(Go + asynq)" as Worker
    component "Graph Service\n(Go, HTTP+gRPC)" as GraphSvc
    database "PostgreSQL 16\n+ pgvector" as DB
    database "Redis 7\n(очереди + кэш + pub/sub)" as Redis
    database "MongoDB 7\n(drafts)" as Mongo
    component "NLP Service\n(Python + FastAPI)" as NLP
}

User --> Frontend : "HTTP (dev stack)"
Frontend --> Backend : "REST /api (proxy)"
Frontend --> GraphSvc : "REST /graph-service/api (proxy)"
Backend --> DB : "SQL"
Backend --> Redis : "TCP (asynq / кэш)"
Backend --> Mongo : "drafts"
Backend --> NLP : "HTTP (эмбеддинги)"
Backend --> GraphSvc : "HTTP :9091 (graph client)"
GraphSvc --> DB : "SQL (graph read)"
GraphSvc --> Redis : "cache + graph:events"
Worker --> Redis : "asynq consume"
Worker --> DB : "SQL"
Worker --> NLP : "HTTP"

note right of Backend
    - Содержит DDD слои
    - CQRS (команды/запросы)
    - Публикует события в Redis graph:events
end note

note right of GraphSvc
    - Раскладки графа, дельты, снимки
    - gRPC :9090 поднят, но без клиентов (A-2)
    - HTTP :9091 — рабочий путь
end note

note right of Redis
    - Хранение задач (asynq)
    - Кэш рекомендаций и graph-service
    - Pub/Sub канал graph:events
end note
@enduml